window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A murderer in our midst. A mysterious connection to the past. An enemy I can’t stop crushing on.</p> <p>I’ve dreamed of attending Spellcasters Spy Academy for as long as I can remember. But as it turns out, it’s not the academic utopia I imagined. This place is dangerous as hell. And I don’t mean the classes. They say the students in the Culling year, my year, are cursed. Someone is picking us off. Or maybe something.</p> <p>Between challenging courses, my irritating crush, and the enigmatic curse, I have my hands full, but there’s no way I’m giving up on my dream. I’m here to stay. That is, as long as I’m not the murderer’s next victim.</p> <p>Fans of Harry Potter, Twilight, and The Craft will love Ashley McLeo’s Spellcasters Spy Academy. Now a complete series. Start your magical adventure in espionage today.</p>"; 
